{
  "id": "earth_pressure_acting_on_basement_walls",
  "title": "Earth Pressure Acting on Basement Walls",
  "description": "Calculate the resultant force, position, and maximum bending moment due to earth pressure acting on basement walls with 1st floor above or at ground level.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Earth Pressure Acting on Basement Walls\n\nCalculate the forces and moments acting on basement walls due to lateral earth pressure. This tool supports two configurations:\n- **1st Floor above Ground Level**: Includes support from basement floor/slab and 1st floor joists\n- **1st Floor at Ground Level**: Simpler case with ground level support\n\n## Key Parameters\n- **hs**: Height of backfill soil (m)\n- **γ**: Specific weight of backfill soil (kN/m³)\n- **K**: Coefficient of earth pressure at rest\n- **ht**: Height from basement floor to 1st floor level (m) - only for 1st floor above ground\n\n## Typical Values\n\n### Poisson's Ratio (μ)\n- Clay: 0.41\n- Sand: 0.29\n- Sandy Clay: 0.37\n- Sandy Loam: 0.31\n\n### Soil Densities (kg/m³)\n- Clay, dry: 1600\n- Sand, dry: 1555"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "configuration",
          "label": "Configuration",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "1",
              "label": "1st Floor Above Ground Level"
            },
            {
              "value": "2",
              "label": "1st Floor at Ground Level"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hs",
          "label": "Height of Backfill Soil (hs)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 2.5
        },
        {
          "id": "poisson_ratio",
          "label": "Poisson's Ratio (μ)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.29
        },
        {
          "id": "soil_density",
          "label": "Soil Density (ρ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1555
        },
        {
          "id": "gravity",
          "label": "Acceleration of Gravity (ag)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m/s²",
          "defaultValue": 9.81
        },
        {
          "id": "ht",
          "label": "Height to 1st Floor (ht)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 3
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "K",
          "label": "Coefficient of Earth Pressure (K)",
          "formula": "inputs.poisson_ratio / (1 - inputs.poisson_ratio)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "gamma",
          "label": "Specific Weight of Soil (γ)",
          "formula": "(inputs.soil_density * inputs.gravity) / 1000",
          "unit": "kN/m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "Fa",
          "label": "Resultant Force (Fa)",
          "formula": "0.5 * (inputs.poisson_ratio / (1 - inputs.poisson_ratio)) * ((inputs.soil_density * inputs.gravity) / 1000) * inputs.hs * inputs.hs",
          "unit": "kN/m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "da",
          "label": "Acting Position Distance (da)",
          "formula": "inputs.hs / 3",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "Mmax",
          "label": "Maximum Bending Moment (Mmax)",
          "formula": "inputs.configuration === 1 ? ((0.5 * (inputs.poisson_ratio / (1 - inputs.poisson_ratio)) * ((inputs.soil_density * inputs.gravity) / 1000) * inputs.hs * inputs.hs * inputs.hs / 3 / inputs.ht) * (inputs.hs + (2 * inputs.hs / 3) * Math.pow(inputs.hs / (3 * inputs.ht), 0.5))) : (0.128 * 0.5 * (inputs.poisson_ratio / (1 - inputs.poisson_ratio)) * ((inputs.soil_density * inputs.gravity) / 1000) * inputs.hs * inputs.hs * inputs.hs)",
          "unit": "kNm/m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "dm",
          "label": "Position of Maximum Moment (dm)",
          "formula": "inputs.configuration === 1 ? (inputs.hs * Math.pow(inputs.hs / (3 * inputs.ht), 0.5)) : (0.42 * inputs.hs)",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Symbol",
        "Value",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Height of Backfill Soil",
          "hs",
          "=inputs.hs",
          "m"
        ],
        [
          "Poisson's Ratio",
          "μ",
          "=inputs.poisson_ratio",
          "-"
        ],
        [
          "Soil Density",
          "ρ",
          "=inputs.soil_density",
          "kg/m³"
        ],
        [
          "Acceleration of Gravity",
          "ag",
          "=inputs.gravity",
          "m/s²"
        ],
        [
          "Coefficient of Earth Pressure",
          "K",
          "=K",
          "-"
        ],
        [
          "Specific Weight of Soil",
          "γ",
          "=gamma",
          "kN/m³"
        ],
        [
          "Resultant Force",
          "Fa",
          "=Fa",
          "kN/m"
        ],
        [
          "Acting Position Distance",
          "da",
          "=da",
          "m"
        ],
        [
          "Maximum Bending Moment",
          "Mmax",
          "=Mmax",
          "kNm/m"
        ],
        [
          "Position of Maximum Moment",
          "dm",
          "=dm",
          "m"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "content": "Basement Wall Earth Pressure Analysis",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Earth Pressure Distribution on Basement Wall",
          "left": "center"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Pressure (kPa)"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Depth (m)",
          "inverse": true
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Earth Pressure",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [
              [
                0,
                0
              ],
              [
                "=Fa*2/inputs.hs",
                "=inputs.hs"
              ]
            ],
            "smooth": true,
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#1890FF"
            },
            "areaStyle": {
              "color": "rgba(24, 144, 255, 0.3)"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}